WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
An ordinary day for a pencil.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.500
“May I borrow it?”

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.100
Suddenly recruited by the lab.

4
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.950
From stationery to science.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Pencil graphite is electrochemically exfoliated into a graphene material.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
A wireless sensor study detecting the DNA epigenetic marker 5hmC.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.950
A conceptual visualization, not actual experimental footage.

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.950
The next pencil? Absolutely not.

9
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A pencil-graphite-based biosensor · ACS Nano (2025)
